                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Did I hear Fitzhume say I was... impatient? I feel... surprised. Do you think I lack patience? Never mind, we don't have time for that.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_MIR_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "What news from Grandfather Tree? He's worse? I see. The Eye of History? Taken to Mirage by the... Cabal? Are you certain? Hmm.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_MIR_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I feel... perplexed. Yes. I think I have heard of this \"Cabal\" - a group of dark Wizards. Mysterious. You should go to Mirage. Talk to Qismah.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IoneVirga_MIR_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
